Package: uncertainr
Type: Package
Title: Uncertainty-Native Bioinformatics Visualization
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Treats statistical uncertainty as a first-class visual element rather than a side annotation. Renders measurement noise, model uncertainty, and annotation ambiguity as decomposed channels in atomic certainty-card glyphs.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
